For KMS, CloudWatch Logs, and SNS configuration, these fields are usually present in describe_trails output when set, so their absence likely means they're not configured for these trails - I'll verify with get_trail calls to be thorough. For the org trail specifically, since it's owned by a different account, I'll need to query it by ARN to get status and selectors as a member account. I'll run all these lookups in parallel across the four trails.

